The identity of the prize would be hidden until you get to the top
of the staircase. Which of the rooms the staircase was in couldn't be
hidden since it'd be revealed by Sokoban's pre-mapping; making it a
magic portal wouldn't help, since traps are pre-mapped too (not to
mention that this would require changing the code as well as the
level and dungeon files).

